#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(package): Agent
type: object
displayName: AgentResponsesPayload
description: |
  Structured fields for the `payload` part of a `multipart/form-data` [/responses](/api/agents/intake-agent#create-a-cart-or-quote-request) request to the Intake Agent. `prompt` is optional when files are attached.

  For an `application/json` request, use [AgentResponsesRequest](ctp:api:type:AgentResponsesRequest) instead.
example: !include ../../examples/agent/AgentResponsesPayload.json
properties:
  outputType:
    type: AgentResponsesOutputType
    description: |
      The entity to create.
  locale:
    type: string
    description: |
      A valid BCP 47 language tag, for example `en-US`.
  prompt?:
    type: string
    description: |
      Natural-language description of the desired Cart or Quote Request, such as the body of an email or a note. Required if no file is attached.
  businessUnit?:
    type: BusinessUnitResourceIdentifier
    description: |
      [BusinessUnit](ctp:api:type:BusinessUnit) to use for the request. If omitted, the Intake Agent resolves it from the input.
  store?:
    type: StoreResourceIdentifier
    description: |
      [Store](ctp:api:type:Store) to use for the request. If omitted, the Intake Agent resolves it from the input.
